package call

// The icons a call app needs: phones, microphones, cameras, speakers.
//
// Converted from lucide-react 1.51.0 by parity/tools/gen-icons.mjs, run
// against this package rather than against shadcn's icons.odin. That
// generator is additive and safe for one writer, but several agents share
// this tree and were regenerating that one file at the same time, so these
// live here instead and `shadcn/` is left untouched. Everything shadcn
// already ships — chevrons, check, x, the alert circle — is still used from
// `sc.` rather than duplicated — chevrons, check, x, the alert circle, the
// spinner and the speaker all come from there.
//
// Every lucide primitive is converted to a single path string, so palmy's
// renderer only needs a path parser. The geometry is lucide's; the
// rasterising is palmy's.

import p "palmy:."

